{"id": "arizona-networking-memoir", "status": "published", "category": "Special 專案", "title": "Arizona networking 回憶錄", "subtitle": "在 Arizona 的飯桌與相聚裡，聊商業，也聊生活與人生。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-arizona-networking-memoir.png", "width": 666, "height": 562, "scale": 1, "fit": "contain", "background": "#ffffff", "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-arizona-networking-memoir-212622ad74e4-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-arizona-networking-memoir-212622ad74e4-666.webp 666w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>在沙漠裡，吃了上田先生家不少米</h3><p>在 Arizona，我遇到了一位做了 20 年商務聯絡的 Hiro 上田先生。沒想到，可以在沙漠吃到比日本還好吃的日式料理。</p><p>在沙漠的這段時間，是真的吃了上田先生家不少米，也學了高爾夫。不只學到了商業知識，也重新審視自己的人生觀，以及「Do more for other」這個理念。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering-5226cf92898d-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-gathering-5226cf92898d-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"在上田先生家相聚的合影。\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>在上田先生家相聚的合影。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal-654f4dfa6d40-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-hiro-home-meal-654f4dfa6d40-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"在上田先生家用餐的回憶。\" width=\"2316\" height=\"3088\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>在上田先生家用餐的回憶。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>臭豆腐大王的餐桌，與 Mel 大哥</h3><p>我與 SIC 永續影響力投資的天使投資人到臭豆腐大王用餐，也在這場餐會認識了 Mel 大哥。</p><p>餐會裡遇到了各行各業的人。原來飯桌上不只有商業，還有生活的酸甜苦辣，以及大家的人生體悟。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal-7ef8106dc9b5-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-meal-7ef8106dc9b5-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"與 SIC 的天使投資人在臭豆腐大王用餐。\" width=\"1477\" height=\"1108\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>與 SIC 的天使投資人在臭豆腐大王用餐。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group-c2f773556ddf-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/arizona-networking-sic-mel-group-c2f773556ddf-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"與 Mel 大哥及大家相聚的餐會合影。\" width=\"1290\" height=\"1009\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>與 Mel 大哥及大家相聚的餐會合影。</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}